830 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (        The SolarCool umbrella is made to help people to stay cool and safe under the harsh sunlight. A lot of students and workers in the Philippines are walking and working outside during the hottest hours of the day. Umbrellas block sunlight, but they can't make you feel fresh and cooler. SolarCool Umbrella gives shade, cool air with a solar-powered fan, and can even charge your phone, all without the use of electricity. After studying the market, we found that many people are looking for new ways to stay cool outdoors, especially during summers and school openings. Market analysis showed us what people really need, what problems they face, and how our product can help. It gave us an idea on how to sell and how to promote it better. This kind of study lowers the risk and helps our business to grow. As more people looking for eco-friendly technology, our SolarCool Umbrella has a great potential to succeed and grow in the market.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
